#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:101
msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "顯示模式"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:134
msgid ""
"Agreement is enabled but the body is empty — checkout will skip rendering "
"until you add some content."
msgstr "合約已啟用但內容為空，在補上內容前結帳頁不會顯示合約。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:151
msgid ""
"Configure the agreement that customers must accept before placing an order."
msgstr "設定客戶必須同意才能下單的合約內容。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:161
msgid "Show the agreement section on checkout and require consent."
msgstr "在結帳頁顯示合約區塊並要求同意。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:205
msgid "Inline scrolling preview (click to enlarge in modal)"
msgstr "內嵌捲動預覽（點擊在彈窗中放大）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:206
msgid "Accordion (collapsed by default)"
msgstr "摺疊（預設收合）"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:220
msgid ""
"Inline scroll keeps the agreement partially visible from the start; the "
"customer can scroll to read or click the box to open a full-size modal. "
"Accordion is collapsed until clicked."
msgstr ""
"「內嵌捲動」模式下合約一開始就部分可見，客戶可在框中捲動閱讀，或點擊框框開啟"
"全螢幕彈窗。「摺疊」模式則預設收合，需點擊才會展開。"

#: src/Settings/SettingsRepository.php:52
msgid "Agreement"
msgstr "合約條款"

#: src/Settings/SettingsRepository.php:54
